---
description: >-
  BT gitGraph where a commit (id A) from the develop branch is cherry-picked onto main, exercising
  the basic cherry-pick syntax in vertical orientation.
---
gitGraph BT:
  commit id: "ZERO"
  branch develop
  commit id:"A"
  checkout main
  commit id:"ONE"
  checkout develop
  commit id:"B"
  checkout main
  commit id:"TWO"
  cherry-pick id:"A"
  commit id:"THREE"
  checkout develop
  commit id:"C"
